.TH OVERLAY 8 "March 2026" "overlayfs-tools" "System Administration Commands"
.SH NAME
overlay \- maintenance tools for OverlayFS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B overlay
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B overlay
provides a set of utilities to manage and maintain OverlayFS filesystems.
Its primary use case is performing "offline merges" where a writable upper
layer (often in RAM) is synchronized back to a persistent lower layer.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B check
Check the consistency of an overlay filesystem.
.TP
.B merge
Merge the changes from the upper directory into the lower directory.
.TP
.B vacuum
Remove duplicated files from the upper directory that are identical to the lower.
.SH OPTIONS
Please refer to the upstream documentation for specific flag arguments.
.SH AUTHOR
Originally written by kmxz and maintained by the overlayfs-tools community.
This manual page was written for the Debian project.
